    "faq_accordion": {
      "type": "faq-accordion",
      "settings": {
        "heading_text_1": "Your Questions,",
        "heading_color_1": "#0B0B0B",
        "heading_text_2": "Answered.",
        "heading_color_2": "#0033FF",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 48,
        "padding-block-end": 48
      },
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_block": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plus",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h4",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "row_1": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is It Safe To Take Every Day?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_1": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Both LONGER+ and STRONGER+ are third-party tested, non-GMO, and free of unnecessary fillers. Every ingredient is chosen for its clinical evidence and safety profile. As always, consult your doctor before beginning any supplement regimen.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_1"]
            },
            "row_2": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How Long Does It Take To Notice Results?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_2": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>It depends on the formula. STRONGER+ is designed for immediate physical output: many users feel improved energy, focus, and endurance within the first week. LONGER+ targets deeper cellular processes, so meaningful results typically develop over 4–8 weeks of consistent use.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_2"]
            },
            "row_3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How Is It Personalized For Me?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_3": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We offer two precision-formulated products targeting different goals. LONGER+ is built for cellular repair, resilience, and longevity. STRONGER+ is designed for daily performance, energy, and recovery. Choose the one that fits your goal — or stack both for full-spectrum support.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_3"]
            },
            "row_4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can My Formula Change As My Goals Evolve?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_4": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Absolutely. You can switch between LONGER+ and STRONGER+, stack both, or adjust your subscription at any time. Your formula should evolve as you do.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_4"]
            },
            "row_5": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can I Take It With Other Supplements?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_5": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
